BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 309.52 Tm (threats, with no refund or reship issued unless the written rules explicitly allow it.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 294.30 Tm (The economics trap is that AI support pricing punishes success. Macha's own review boils its Gorgias criticism down to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 279.07 Tm (two lines, you do the work and price grows with success, and spells out that the $550 Pro plan splits into $360 helpdesk) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 263.85 Tm (for 2,000 tickets and $190 AI for 190 interactions, with $1.50 per interaction past that, while a human reply inside 72) Tj ET
