BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 235.72 Tm (the app is connected and that a 'Pending' status is normal. Sync failures also masquerade as feed problems. Ecom Chris) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 220.50 Tm (checks diagnostics first and reads a disapproval rate around 0.3% as usually a sync issue, fixed by a resync rather than a) Tj ET
